[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Scope

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
This report contains a detailed test description to conduct verification testing of GBSK 1.0 HVPS
Interface Bootloader Firmware that covers GBSK HVPS Interface Bootloader FW SRS.
<<<

